(1. Fundamental Complex Equation: S_imaginary(x, y, n, t) = (x + i*y)^n + Integral_0^1 xi^xi d(xi)) Tj
0 -12 Td
(2. Complex Newton Binomial Expansion: (x + i*y)^n = Sum_{k=0}^n [ n! / (k!(n-k)!) ] * x^{n-k} * (i*y)^k) Tj
0 -12 Td
